#: 8bc70d229de64394836e7267560490cf ada49bcdd10b4a27a2618ff51f24c38e
msgid ""
"Arming and operation in ACRO and STABILIZE modes is possible. It is also "
"possible to arm and fly in ALTHOLD, but altitude hold performance relies on "
"accelerometer/gyro exclusively and could be exceptionally poor, even "
"resulting in a crash so is not recommended. As with Plane you can use a GPS "
"for altitude data, but Rangefinders and Beacons can also be used and the "
"``EK3_SCRX_POSZ`` parameters set appropriately."
msgstr ""
"可以在 Acro 和 Stabilize 模式下解锁和飞行。也可以在 AltHold "
"模式下解锁飞行，但高度保持性能完全依赖加速度计/陀螺仪，可能极差甚至导致坠机，因此不建议。与 Plane 一样，可以使用 GPS "
"提供高度数据，也可以使用测距仪和信标，并适当设置 ``EK3_SCRX_POSZ`` 参数。"

